The main idea is that all options supported on AlphaServers or 
AlphaStations are supported in Tru64 unix also.

Check your Alpha system supported options at:
http://h18002.www1.hp.com/alphaserver/products/options.html

Btw. The ATI Radeon 7500 PCI is the PBXGG
http://h18002.www1.hp.com/alphaserver/options/asds10/asds10_3x-pbxgg-aa.html

The resolution by default is usually a very modest one, but you can 
configure it to any mode the adapter and your monitor supports by 
editing the configuration file like in the following example:

http://unix.derkeiler.com/Mailing-Lists/Tru64-UNIX-Managers/2004-06/0085.html

